---
description: "SEO requirements for PixelForge public pages"
globs: ["apps/web/src/app/**/page.tsx", "apps/web/src/app/**/layout.tsx"]
alwaysApply: false
---
# Every public page must export Metadata
- title: 50-60 chars, format "Page — PixelForge"
- description: 150-160 chars, action-oriented
- openGraph + twitter card summary_large_image
- alternates.canonical when production URL is known

# Required files
- app/sitemap.ts — dynamic sitemap
- app/robots.ts — allow public, disallow /dashboard, /api, /admin, /overview, /history, /usage, /settings, /presets
- app/opengraph-image.tsx — OG image
- app/icon.tsx and app/apple-icon.tsx when practical

# Structured data (JSON-LD)
- SoftwareApplication on landing
- FAQPage on FAQ section
- BreadcrumbList on tool / docs pages

# Content
- Each tool page targets one primary keyword
- H1 contains the keyword naturally
- First 100 words include keyword + value proposition
- Internal links: every tool page links to 2-3 related tools

# Technical
- Prefer next/image with descriptive alt
- Primary content SSR or SSG — never client-only for SEO pages
- Core Web Vitals targets: LCP < 2.5s, CLS < 0.1, INP < 200ms
- Fonts via next/font with display swap
